1
00:00:00,631 --> 00:00:02,511
(Penny:)It's open.

2
00:00:03,759 --> 00:00:05,889
(Leonard:)Hey, you ready to go?

3
00:00:06,053 --> 00:00:09,143
Yeah, ju...
Hang on, let me just finish this chapter.

4
00:00:09,389 --> 00:00:12,229
- Well, can you finish it later?
- No, I can't.

5
00:00:12,392 --> 00:00:15,982
(Penny:)Reading books is a big part
of my life now because, you know:

6
00:00:16,146 --> 00:00:19,896
"We'd have more fun things to talk about
if I read more."

7
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:25,905
(Leonard:)Great. Good, great.
What are you reading?

8
00:00:26,406 --> 00:00:28,906
Two Weeks to Rock-Hard Abs.

9
00:00:29,868 --> 00:00:33,408
(Leonard:)They kind of spoil the ending
right in the name of that, don't they?

10
00:00:34,498 --> 00:00:38,338
(Leonard:)All right. Look.
Just remember how this works.

11
00:00:38,502 --> 00:00:40,542
(Leonard:)We don't get mad about these things.

12
00:00:40,712 --> 00:00:44,342
Speaking of which, l've addressed
your bug report on my date planning.

13
00:00:44,508 --> 00:00:48,008
I've got a really fun evening for you.
It's kind of a surprise.

14
00:00:48,178 --> 00:00:51,888
All right, terrific. Let me just go
find a pair of shoes that aren't so tall.

15
00:00:52,057 --> 00:00:59,027
(Penny:)We wouldn't want you to feel like you
were "out for a walk with your mommy."

